  "content": "\n\n<p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252f4wkDVG6h\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ym2MQ1wH/meccha-crafteleon-title.png\" alt=\"Meccha Crafteleon\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Join us-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f4704690%252fMECCHA_CHAMELEON%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Original Game-Meccha Chameleon-navy?style=for-the-badge&logo=steam&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Original Game: Meccha Chameleon\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meccha-crafteleon/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Required Mod-Meccha Crafteleon-F16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Required Mod: Meccha Crafteleon\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>🌍 <strong>公開伺服器：</strong> <code>5.196.90.238:25570</code> (MC 1.21.11)</p>\n<h2>Meccha Crafteleon 官方地圖</h2>\n<p>專為<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meccha-crafteleon/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meccha Crafteleon</a></strong>設計的官方捉迷藏地圖包：一個溫馨的集結中心供你與朋友匯合，以及 5 張為變色龍回合預先設定好的競技場。</p>\n<p><strong>你是建築師嗎？在 Discord 申請，讓你的作品出現在我們的地圖中！</strong></p>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fRp5Mr4TG\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3yJ86Ym5/meccha-hub.jpg\" alt=\"meccha 中心\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fF4nhY01s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RT7g6BKh/coffee.jpg\" alt=\"咖啡廳\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fJj2cmbfD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PG4rFb7q/cottage.jpg\" alt=\"小屋\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fwhRrGJpL\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZzV14HcJ/factory.jpg\" alt=\"工廠\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fym5LJk3c\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p6ZCpKmB/mangrove.jpg\" alt=\"紅樹林\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fvyHM1Mt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4v70W0Q/trainstation.jpg\" alt=\"火車站\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<h3>地圖內容</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>1 個集結中心</strong>：重生點、鎖定遊戲規則、夜視效果與歡迎指南。從這裡開啟房間即可出發。</li>\n  <li><strong>5 個競技場</strong>：大小與主題各異，邊界已針對公平對戰進行調整。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>推薦搭配模組</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Simple Voice Chat</strong>：近距離語音，聽到附近變色龍的偷笑聲是遊戲樂趣的一半。</li>\n  <li><strong>Sound Physics Remastered</strong>：3D 音效，哨聲會確實從特定方向傳來。</li>\n  <li><strong>Sodium + Iris</strong>：流暢的幀率（注意：光影會遮蔽房間視角濾鏡）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>使用方法</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>需要安裝<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meccha-crafteleon/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meccha Crafteleon</a></strong> 模組（NeoForge）。建議與 2 至 16 位朋友一起遊玩體驗最佳。</li>\n  <li>單人/區域網路：將資料夾放入你的 <code>saves/</code> 目錄。伺服器：將其作為世界資料夾使用。</li>\n  <li>遊戲內：輸入 <code>/meccha</code> 開啟選單，在房間面板右側選擇競技場，然後點擊開始。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>躲藏者會塗抹自己以融入環境，追捕者則會射擊看起來可疑的目標。祝遊玩愉快。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Join us-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252faminoquiz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Donate-Ko--fi-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"贊助\"></a></p>\n<p>沒有伺服器？透過<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fmecchacrafteleonsmp\" rel=\"nofollow\">我們的合作夥伴</a>建立伺服器，每月最低只需 <strong>1.49 美元</strong>，使用代碼 <code>AMINE</code> 可享 <strong>8 折優惠</strong>！</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fmecchacrafteleonsmp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1493170/description_2156c264-8c2e-4898-a3b3-a6a997a30ce7.png\" alt=\"Wabbanode\"></a>\n  <br><em>一鍵設定。準備好與朋友享受遊戲之夜。</em>\n</p>",
